{
    "title": "Scoreboard - Keep score",
    "description": "Scoreboard App is a user-friendly app that helps you keep track of the score of two teams in any game. Whether it's a sports game, a board game, or a friendly competition with friends, Scoreboard App is the perfect tool to keep track of the score and timer.\r\n\r\n** Many great features you will get:\r\n\u2022 Easy Scorekeeping: Scoreboard App makes it easy to keep track of the score of two teams\r\n\u2022 Custom Team Names: You can set custom names for the two teams, making it easier to keep track of who's who\r\n\u2022 Customizable Scoreboard: Scoreboard App allows you to customize the look of the scoreboard with different colors and styles.\r\n\u2022 Timer: Scoreboard App has a timer feature, allowing you to set a time limit for your game\r\n\u2022 Landscape and Portrait Mode: Scoreboard App supports both landscape and portrait modes and support display on tablet also\r\n\u2022 User-friendly Interface: Scoreboard App has a user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate\r\n\r\n** How to use:\r\nJust tap or swipe up the side that scored to increase point, swipe down to decrease point! Reset the score to start a new game.\r\n\r\nScoreboard can be used for many sports and activities like:\r\nBasketball, Football / Soccer, Volleyball, Hockey, Tennis, Table Tennis / Ping Pong, Badminton, Baseball / Softball, Rugby, Handball, Cornhole / Bean Bag Toss, Board games, Indoor / outdoor games and many more.\r\n\r\nIf Scoreboard has been helpful to you and you have enjoyed using it, I would be grateful if you could take a moment to leave a review, as it would make a big difference! :)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Scoreboard App is a user-friendly app that helps you keep track of the score of two teams in any game. Whether it&#39;s a sports game, a board game, or a friendly competition with friends, Scoreboard App is the perfect tool to keep track of the score and timer.<br><br>** Many great features you will get:<br>\u2022 Easy Scorekeeping: Scoreboard App makes it easy to keep track of the score of two teams<br>\u2022 Custom Team Names: You can set custom names for the two teams, making it easier to keep track of who&#39;s who<br>\u2022 Customizable Scoreboard: Scoreboard App allows you to customize the look of the scoreboard with different colors and styles.<br>\u2022 Timer: Scoreboard App has a timer feature, allowing you to set a time limit for your game<br>\u2022 Landscape and Portrait Mode: Scoreboard App supports both landscape and portrait modes and support display on tablet also<br>\u2022 User-friendly Interface: Scoreboard App has a user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate<br><br>** How to use:<br>Just tap or swipe up the side that scored to increase point, swipe down to decrease point! Reset the score to start a new game.<br><br>Scoreboard can be used for many sports and activities like:<br>Basketball, Football / Soccer, Volleyball, Hockey, Tennis, Table Tennis / Ping Pong, Badminton, Baseball / Softball, Rugby, Handball, Cornhole / Bean Bag Toss, Board games, Indoor / outdoor games and many more.<br><br>If Scoreboard has been helpful to you and you have enjoyed using it, I would be grateful if you could take a moment to leave a review, as it would make a big difference! :)",
